# pop'n music 11: test mode > NETWORK OPTIONS (item 7) > e-AMUSEMENT OPTIONS > e-AMUSEMENT ON, SAVE AND
# EXIT. The game then asks for a power cycle; run oracle/scripts/popn11-card-new.his with the same --nvram.
#   hiraku-popn11 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn11-eamuse-on.his
game popn11
at 3000 press "Test" 10
at 3300 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3320 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3340 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3360 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3380 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3400 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3420 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3500 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 3600 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 3740 hold "P1 Button 5"
at 3760 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3790 release "P1 Button 5"
at 3840 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3860 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3880 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3900 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3920 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3960 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 4130 quit
